title: "IPFLang: Domain-Specific Language for Intellectual Property Fee Calculations"
version: 1.2.0
date-released: 2025-12-15
abstract: "A domain-specific language and execution engine for defining intellectual property fee calculations with advanced features including currency-aware type system, completeness verification, provenance tracking, temporal operations, and version management."
